Package: cpueTargeting
Title: Simulators for CPUE Targeting and Standardization
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Henning", "Winker", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "henning.winker@fao.org")
Description: Multispecies operating models for exploring spatial and
    vertical targeting and catch-per-unit-effort standardization. Includes
    the multi-habitat cluster example of Winker et al. (2014), the
    four-species bathymetric Run 22 model, and a longline tuna model in which
    hook depth by hooks-between-floats follows the habitat-based approach of
    Bigelow et al. (2002).
License: GPL-3 + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
